.Dd May 27, 2026
.Dt DATA 1
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm data
.Nd query Codeforces and import contest data
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm make
.Cm meta
.Op Ar rating
.Op Ar tag ...
.Nm make
.Cm pick
.Ar handle
.Op Ar rating
.Op Ar tag ...
.Nm make
.Cm contest
.Ar contest
.Nm make
.Cm sample
.Ar index
.Ar contest
.Nm make
.Cm seen
.Ar handle
.Nm make
.Cm solved
.Ar handle
.Nm make
.Cm rank
.Ar handle | contests | contest
.Nm make
.Cm cc
.Sh DESCRIPTION
These commands use public Codeforces data to reduce typing.
They do not solve problems.
They keep their cache below
.Pa .build/cf/ .
.Pp
.Cm meta
prints problem metadata.
It can filter by problem id, rating, rating range, and tags.
.Pp
.Cm pick
reads a user's accepted submissions and prints unsolved problems matching
the requested rating and tags.
.Pp
.Cm contest
reads public standings for a contest and creates the corresponding source
files and test directories.
It also writes contest metadata below
.Pa .build/cf/ .
.Pp
.Cm sample
tries public online sources for sample tests and writes
.Pa case-*.in
and
.Pa case-*.out .
The official Codeforces API does not publish samples.
Direct HTML fetches may be blocked by a browser challenge.
.Pp
.Cm cc
starts a small HTTP listener for Competitive Companion.
Open a problem in the browser and send it from the extension.
This is the most reliable way to import samples when the web site requires
a browser.
.Pp
.Cm seen
prints the problems a handle has attempted.
.Cm solved
compares local solution files with accepted submissions for a handle.
.Cm rank
prints user rating history, upcoming contests, or rating changes for one
contest.
.Sh ENVIRONMENT
.Bl -tag -width "CF_HANDLE"
.It Ev CF_HANDLE
Default Codeforces handle for commands which need one.
.El
.Sh FILES
.Bl -tag -width ".Pa .build/cf/problems.tsv"
.It Pa .build/cf/problems.tsv
Cached problem table written by
.Cm meta .
.It Pa .build/cf/contest-2227.tsv
Contest problem table written by
.Cm contest .
.El
.Sh EXAMPLES
.Bd -literal -offset indent
make meta 1600 dp
make pick tourist 1600 dp
make contest 2227
make sample A 71
make cc
make seen tourist
make solved tourist
make rank tourist
make rank contests
make rank 566
.Ed
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr build 1 ,
.Xr test 1 ,
.Xr probs 7
